==Battleground==
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Misaki Konno (Enemy)|Misaki Konno]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.
**7 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

